error: `p` is given values that are never read
  `p` is a copy of `rect.corner`: what is written to it does not reach `rect.corner`
  --> error_unread_copy.sg:14:9
 14 |     var p = rect.corner
    |         ^
  it is written here:
  --> error_unread_copy.sg:15:5
 15 |     p.x = 0
    |     ^^^
  hint: to change `rect.corner` itself, borrow it: `var p = ref rect.corner`
